  triage:verifiedInRound "ttl-reconcile-ay-r1 (content-verified against QA-AY3-R3/R4 evidence)" ;
  triage:resolutionNote "Content-verified fixed on feature/ay3-herdr-endpoint-doctor-config: git show c8bfb76e3:crates/atm-herdr/src/transport_cli.rs shows child.wait()'s Ok(Err(error)) arm now returns Err(server_unavailable(error)), preserving the io::Error via the same helper as AY3-QA-003. Matches commit d02d57c21 ('fix(herdr): preserve binary spawn error kinds'), verified by QA-AY3-R3 (PASS 0/0/0 at b8afa814f) and QA-AY3-R4 (FAIL only on AY3-QA-002 at c8bfb76e3). Finding-level status set to fixed_partial, not fixed: PR #1273 has not merged to integrate/phase-ay, and the integrate occurrence (AY3-2) remains open." .

